=== HINT 1 ===
Key <string.h> functions:
  strcpy(dst, src)      copy src into dst
  strcat(dst, src)      append src onto dst
  strcmp(a, b)          0 if equal, <0 if a<b, >0 if a>b
  strlen(s)             number of chars (not counting '\0')

=== HINT 2 ===
Steps:
  1. strcpy(buf, first)   -> "Ada"
  2. strcat(buf, " ")     -> "Ada "
  3. strcat(buf, last)    -> "Ada Lovelace"

=== HINT 3 (SPOILER) ===
strcpy(buf, first);
strcat(buf, " ");
strcat(buf, last);
